      "extract": "MARKOV TRACES ON DEGENERATE CYCLOTOMIC HECKE ALGEBRAS DEKE ZHAO Dedicated to Professor Yingbo Zhang on the occasion of her 80th birthday Abstract. Let Hn(u) be the degenerate cyclotomic Hecke algebra with parameter u = {u1, . . . , um}. The paper aims to define and construct the (non-)normalized Markov traces on the sequence {Hn(u)}∞ n=1. This allows us to provide the Brou´e–Malle–Michel symmetrizing trace on Hn(u)",
      "extractCut": true,
